        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Albany, New York; Delaware Avenue; U.S. Route 9W; New York State Route 443\n- Buildings: Hook and Ladder No. 4\n- People: Marcus T. Reynolds; Cuyler Reynolds\n- Roles: Albany historian; author\n\nFacts:\n- Hook and Ladder No. 4, originally named Truck No. 4, is a firehouse in Albany, New York.\n- Hook and Ladder No. 4 is located on Delaware Avenue, which is designated as U.S. Route 9W and New York State Route 443 in Albany, New York.\n- Cuyler Reynolds was an Albany historian and author.\n- Marcus T. Reynolds was the brother of Cuyler Reynolds.",
